# `structure::Frame`

An immutable compiled frame of rigidly jointed members.

## Signature

```cpp
std::int64_t structure::Frame::nodes() const noexcept;
std::int64_t structure::Frame::members() const noexcept;
std::int64_t structure::Frame::dofs() const noexcept;
```

## Construction

Accessors return counts.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`nodes`](FrameModel/nodes.md) | The number of nodes. |
| [`members`](FrameModel/members.md) | The number of members. |
| [`dofs`](FrameModel/dofs.md) | The degrees of freedom per node, always 3. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

